<title>USA: Secure Computing names Waxman as chairman.</title>
<headline>Secure Computing names Waxman as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secure Computing Corp said Wednesday that it elected Jeffrey Waxman to the additional position of chairman of its board of directors, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Waxman joined the company in November 1996 as president and chief executive officer in November 1996.  </p>
<p>Waxman succeeds former CEO and president Kermit Beseke, who resigned as chairman earlier this month.</p>
<p>Secure Computing designs network security products.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
